00:04:17.663 --> 00:04:20.130
that might be above what
you wanna do on the base M2,

00:04:20.130 --> 00:04:21.420
that's awesome on the M2 Pro.

00:04:21.420 --> 00:04:23.850
This model starts at $1299.

00:04:23.850 --> 00:04:24.683
Not cheap, of course,

